Example
This example shows how to access the values from a 
PHP associative array:

 <?php
$jsonobj = '{"Peter":35,"Ben":37,"Joe":43}';

 $arr = json_decode($jsonobj, true);

echo $arr["Peter"];
echo $arr["Ben"];

 echo $arr["Joe"];
?>

